athrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\arctan{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f5e4d6fa-219e-5e15-8eee-4bf63bc6ff6a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f5e4d6fa-219e-5e15-8eee-4bf63bc6ff6a" :question/answer-fields "5251532e-275d-5ec8-86b0-fc8e529c8895"] [:db/ensure "f5e4d6fa-219e-5e15-8eee-4bf63bc6ff6a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "f5e4d6fa-219e-5e15-8eee-4bf63bc6ff6a"] [:db/add "0aa846a1-8098-56fa-b5b0-dba9688c489e" :answer/id #uuid "0aa846a1-8098-56fa-b5b0-dba9688c489e"] [:db/add "0aa846a1-8098-56fa-b5b0-dba9688c489e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0aa846a1-8098-56fa-b5b0-dba9688c489e" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "0aa846a1-8098-56fa-b5b0-dba9688c489e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1751a7e2-e9cd-5eac-84ad-6937d220e4b8" :answer/id #uuid "1751a7e2-e9cd-5eac-84ad-6937d220e4b8"] [:db/add "1751a7e2-e9cd-5eac-84ad-6937d220e4b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1751a7e2-e9cd-5eac-84ad-6937d220e4b8" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "1751a7e2-e9cd-5eac-84ad-6937d220e4b8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d122ef8a-bd0a-5fc7-8a56-a49ba492380f" :answer/id #uuid "d122ef8a-bd0a-5fc7-8a56-a49ba492380f"] [:db/add "d122ef8a-bd0a-5fc7-8a56-a49ba492380f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d122ef8a-bd0a-5fc7-8a56-a49ba492380f" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "d122ef8a-bd0a-5fc7-8a56-a49ba492380f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "14e87b93-b675-557f-b53e-ddf6c52121b9" :answer/id #uuid "14e87b93-b675-557f-b53e-ddf6c52121b9"] [:db/add "14e87b93-b675-557f-b53e-ddf6c52121b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "