{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{2}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "47de0ac9-f092-5b81-9d83-313ace789357" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "47de0ac9-f092-5b81-9d83-313ace789357" :question/answer-fields "2554c77f-6748-58e4-9b7b-a4e227f83aad"] [:db/ensure "47de0ac9-f092-5b81-9d83-313ace789357" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "47de0ac9-f092-5b81-9d83-313ace789357"] [:db/add "a2f9e65d-6d56-5409-b49d-05a36a1367b8" :answer/id #uuid "a2f9e65d-6d56-5409-b49d-05a36a1367b8"] [:db/add "a2f9e65d-6d56-5409-b49d-05a36a1367b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a2f9e65d-6d56-5409-b49d-05a36a1367b8" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "a2f9e65d-6d56-5409-b49d-05a36a1367b8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "519275dd-ca3f-530d-b7cf-ad7dfe50ab37" :answer/id #uuid "519275dd-ca3f-530d-b7cf-ad7dfe50ab37"] [:db/add "519275dd-ca3f-530d-b7cf-ad7dfe50ab37" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "519275dd-ca3f-530d-b7cf-ad7dfe50ab37" :answer/value "\\frac{9 \\arctan{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "519275dd-ca3f-530d-b7cf-ad7dfe50ab37" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ec934ae7-4a05-50c1-b205-9e6bf36c2b60" :answer/id #uuid "ec934ae7-4a05-50c1-b205-9e6bf36c2b60"] [:db/add "ec934ae7-4a05-50c1-b205-9e6bf36c2b60" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ec934ae7-4a05-50c1-b205-9e6bf36c2b60" :answer/value "- \\frac{6 \\arctan{\\left(5