n/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "c63e701c-6695-5b9a-b2af-b1c88c6d680b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{3}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\arctan{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "c63e701c-6695-5b9a-b2af-b1c88c6d680b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "c63e701c-6695-5b9a-b2af-b1c88c6d680b" :question/answer-fields "ac5119a7-cdce-523c-b1a5-cc109d9a7a2a"] [:db/ensure "c63e701c-6695-5b9a-b2af-b1c88c6d680b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "c63e701c-6695-5b9a-b2af-b1c88c6d680b"] [:db/add "c65aa482-4267-5e3c-963e-ec56cba4db9d" :answer/id #uuid "c65aa482-4267-5e3c-963e-ec56cba4db9d"] [:db/add "c65aa482-4267-5e3c-963e-ec56cba4db9d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c65aa482-4267-5e3c-963e-ec56cba4db9d" :answer/value "3 x+C"] [:db/ensure "c65aa482-4267-5e3c-963e-ec56cba4db9d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1089106d-88e0-5948-b280-89e737be3c49" :answer/id #uuid "1089106d-88e0-5948-b280-89e737be3c49"] [:db/add "1089106d-88e0-5948-b280-89e737be3c49" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1089106d-88e0-5948-b280-89e737be3c49" :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "1089106d-88e0-5948-b280-89e737be3c49" :