ect "1089106d-88e0-5948-b280-89e737be3c49"] [:db/ensure "1623eb08-9f4f-567f-b046-2686e8cb9eaa" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "db04ce03-1959-5d7d-91b0-8b560a6f6b99" :question/id #uuid "db04ce03-1959-5d7d-91b0-8b560a6f6b99"] [:db/add "db04ce03-1959-5d7d-91b0-8b560a6f6b99" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "db04ce03-1959-5d7d-91b0-8b560a6f6b99" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{4}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4 \\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "db04ce03-1959-5d7d-91b0-8b560a6f6b99" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "db04ce03-1959-5d7d-91b0-8b560a6f6b99" :question/answer-fields "1623eb08-9f4f-567f-b046-2686e8cb9eaa"] [:db/ensure "db04ce03-1959-5d7d-91b0-8b560a6f6b99" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "db04ce03-1959-5d7d-91b0-8b560a6f6b99"] [:db/add "35121cc6-93bf-54d8-b9e4-d2e6b2a9ead7" :answer/id #uuid "35121cc6-93bf-54d8-b9e4-d2e6b2a9ead7"] [:db/add "35121cc6-93bf-54d8-b9e4-d2e6b2a9ead7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "35121cc6-93bf-54d8-b9e4-d2e6b2a9ead7" :answer/value "\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "35121cc6-93bf-54d8-b9e4-d2e6b2a9ead7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b5ff2804-50ca-593f-9